---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Talha M Blog">
  <section class="article-head"><h1>About</h1></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Talha M Blog explains news and trending stories in plain English, so that anyone can follow them step by step. Every post is written to answer one simple question: what happened, and why does it matter?</p>

    <h2>What we write about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/category/pakistan-news/">Pakistan News</a>: politics, government and events inside Pakistan.</li>
      <li><a href="/category/us-news/">US News</a>: important stories from the United States.</li>
      <li><a href="/category/celebrity/">Celebrity</a>: news and life stories of famous people.</li>
      <li><a href="/category/ai/">AI</a>: new AI tools, coding agents and AI news, explained simply.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Where possible, we list our sources at the bottom of each post, so you can read the original reports yourself.</li>
      <li>Every post shows the date and time it was published, in Pakistan time (PKT).</li>
      <li>When a post is updated, the page shows an "Updated" date.</li>
      <li>A green dot beside a post means it was published in the last 48 hours.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>News changes quickly, and mistakes can happen. If you find something wrong, please email us at <a href="mailto:lartkapagal@gmail.com">lartkapagal@gmail.com</a> and we will fix it and mark the post as updated.</p>

    <h2>Written by</h2>
    <p>Talha M Blog is run by Talha M.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions, feedback or suggestions, email <a href="mailto:lartkapagal@gmail.com">lartkapagal@gmail.com</a>.</p>

  </div>
</Base>